{
  "key": 40636,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_ThisIsTheLostTower",
      "en_US": [
        "Where departed Pokémon sleep...\n",
        "This is the Lost Tower."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La Tour Perdue... L’endroit où\n",
        "reposent les Pokémon disparus."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_ThereIsABrokenTower",
      "en_US": [
        "There is a broken, crumbling tower\n",
        "made of stone..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vous faites face à une tour de pierre \n",
        "brisée, sur le point de s’écrouler..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_UseTheOddKeystone",
      "en_US": [
        "There is a broken, crumbling tower\n",
        "made of stone...\r",
        "There seems to be a spot that would\n",
        "be a perfect fit for the Odd Keystone.\r",
        "Would you like to use the Odd\n",
        "Keystone?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vous faites face à une tour de pierre \n",
        "brisée, sur le point de s’écrouler...\r",
        "Vous remarquez une cavité qui semble\n",
        "correspondre à la Clé de Voûte.\r",
        "Souhaitez-vous utiliser la\n",
        "Clé de Voûte?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_PlayerUsedTheOddKeystone",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} pushed the Odd Keystone\n",
        "into the stone tower.\r",
        "The stone tower has been restored!\n",
        "“Hallowed Tower” is written on it."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} a placé la Clé de Voûte\n",
        "dans la tour de pierre.\r",
        "La tour de pierre est réparée! On peut\n",
        "y lire l’inscription “Tour Sacrée”."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_BuiltManyYearsAgo",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s the Hallowed Tower.\r",
        "It appears to have been built\n",
        "many years ago."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est la Tour Sacrée.\r",
        "Elle semble avoir été construite\n",
        "il y a très longtemps."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_StonesAppearToHaveShifted",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s the Hallowed Tower.\r",
        "Its stones appear to have shifted..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est la Tour Sacrée.\r",
        "On dirait que ses pierres ont bougé..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_CryingComingFromInside",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s the Hallowed Tower.\r",
        "...Is that crying coming from inside\n",
        "the tower?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est la Tour Sacrée.\r",
        "... Est-ce un cri qui semble\n",
        "s’échapper de la tour?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_IsTheTowerShaking",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s the Hallowed Tower.\r",
        "...Is the tower shaking ever so\n",
        "slightly?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est la Tour Sacrée.\r",
        "... On dirait qu’elle est parcourue\n",
        "d’un léger tremblement!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_SomeSortOfPresence",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s the Hallowed Tower.\r",
        "There is some sort of presence...\n",
        "It appears ready to emerge!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est la Tour Sacrée.\r",
        "Vous sentez une présence...\n",
        "Elle semble sur le point d’émerger!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_SpiritombCry",
      "en_US": "Yulaaah!\r",
      "fr_FR": "Spiritoooo!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_GoodRodIsReallyGood",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm!\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} is really good!\r",
        "Wouldn’t you agree?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hum!\n",
        "J’adore la {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Et toi, tu es du même avis?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_TakeThisGoodRod",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm!\n",
        "We’re of identical minds!\r",
        "Hmm!\n",
        "Take this {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hum!\n",
        "On pense exactement la même chose!\r",
        "Hum!\n",
        "Prends cette {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_DoINeedToExplain",
      "en_US": [
        "Try fishing wherever there is\n",
        "a body of water.\r",
        "Oh, incidentally, do you need me to\n",
        "explain how to use that fishing rod?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Essaie de pêcher à chaque fois que\n",
        "tu croises un point d’eau.\r",
        "Tant qu’on y est, tu veux que\n",
        "je t’apprenne à utiliser cette canne?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_YouDontLikeToFish",
      "en_US": "You don’t like to fish?",
      "fr_FR": "Tu n’aimes pas pêcher?"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_ExplainHowToFish",
      "en_US": [
        "First, you face any body of water,\n",
        "then you use your fishing rod.\r",
        "Next, you must focus!\n",
        "If a Pokémon bites, “!” appears.\f",
        "That’s your cue to reel it in!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "D’abord, tu fais face au point d’eau,\n",
        "et tu utilises ta canne à pêche.\r",
        "Ensuite, tu dois te concentrer!\n",
        "Si un Pokémon mord, “!” apparaît.\f",
        "C’est le moment où tu dois tirer!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_WhenYouReelYouBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "When you’re fishing for Pokémon,\n",
        "the first hurdle is getting a bite.\r",
        "When you start to reel that Pokémon\n",
        "in, you’ve got to battle it.\r",
        "So, fishing gives you twice the fun!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Pour pêcher des Pokémon, il faut déjà\n",
        "avoir une touche.\r",
        "Ensuite, il faut se battre pour\n",
        "remonter le Pokémon.\r",
        "Deux étapes, pour deux\n",
        "fois plus de sport!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_DoYouJogEveryMorning",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you jog every morning?\n",
        "Well, I do!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu fais ton jogging tous les matins?\n",
        "Moi oui!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_PokemonChasedAfterMe",
      "en_US": [
        "When I was jogging the other day,\n",
        "a wild Pokémon chased after me.\r",
        "I swear, I ran on top of the water!\n",
        "I was so freaked out!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "L’autre jour, pendant mon jogging, un\n",
        "Pokémon sauvage a voulu me mordre.\r",
        "J’ai couru si vite, sans rire, qu’à\n",
        "la fin je marchais sur l’eau!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_SignHearthomeCity",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 209\n",
        "Hearthome City"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Route 209\n",
        "Unionpolis"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_SignSolaceonTown",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 209\n",
        "Solaceon Town"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Route 209\n",
        "Bonville"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209_Text_TrainerTipsRegisterKeyItems",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "You may register one of the Key\n",
        "Items in your Bag for instant use.\r",
        "Simply press the Y Button to use the\n",
        "registered item instantly."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Conseils aux Dresseurs\r",
        "Vous pouvez sélectionner un Objet Rare\n",
        "dans le Sac pour l’avoir à disposition.\r",
        "Il vous suffit d’appuyer sur le bouton Y\n",
        "pour l’utiliser instantanément."
      ]
    }
  ]
}